  "description": "The man steps into a secret club shrouded in mystery, a place he had only heard about in whispers. Inside, he finds a hidden world where countless beastmen exist to fulfill every imaginable desire. As he is drawn into the unfamiliar stage performances and a private encounter with a catman, the club manager appears with an innocent newcomer, a cowman. After introducing him and giving the guests a small taste, the manager makes a dramatic announcement. The man has been chosen as the one who will be the first to claim and shatter that innocence everyone has been craving… \n\n(Source: Lezhin US)\n\n*Note: Part of Lezhin's Bimilkeulleom Danpyeonseon (비밀클럽 단편선) Collection.*",
